Unconstrained exploratory investigation of **{{ area }}**.

You have NO vulnerability class, NO entry points, NO recon notes, and NO
threat model context for this task. That is deliberate: the current threat
model may mark this area safe or low-risk, and this investigation exists to
check that assumption.

- Treat every input, boundary, and assumption in **{{ area }}** as UNTRUSTED.
  Do not import any prior judgement that this area is safe.
- Audit the area fresh: read what it does, who calls it, what it consumes,
  and where its outputs go.
- Report anything an attacker could do here that the class-driven hunters
  would not have looked for.
